Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:04.24,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:09.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這... 這是多豪華的早餐啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:12.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這些是小蝶做的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:14.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.59,0:00:18.03,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,吃了這美味 從大清早就飛揚起來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:20.95,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空的三明治也很可愛呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.33,0:00:22.80,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,闊愛呀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.79,0:00:26.30,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.89,0:00:28.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:30.08,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,開始！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:33.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:36.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.39,0:00:38.17,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,先吃哪個呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.59,0:00:41.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,少年是鳥嘛 喜歡吃菜的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:43.22,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,給你多盛一點！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.95,0:00:46.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我也能吃其他的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.67,0:00:51.45,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！那就給你多一點三明治和水果！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:56.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不用費心了！我自己來就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.21,0:02:37.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}蝶華和翼 神彩飛揚地向前衝！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.21,0:02:37.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}{\fs50}colorful
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.01,0:02:41.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,來 拿好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.89,0:02:42.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.70,0:02:44.64,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你還做了便當嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.02,0:02:47.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這可是充滿了我的愛哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.14,0:02:49.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:52.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我們走了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.69,0:02:54.24,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,一路順風
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.42,0:02:55.26,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,風
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:58.27,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,哎喲！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.85,0:03:00.85,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.22,0:03:04.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微讓一讓
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:06.38,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.74,0:03:09.94,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,哎喲！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.33,0:03:12.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主手真巧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.10,0:03:14.68,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,巧手！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.16,0:03:20.95,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 你... 你在做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.50,0:03:22.84,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,打掃鳥巢！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.27,0:03:25.02,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 我自己來...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.58,0:03:28.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這 這是什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.11,0:03:31.71,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,裝飾鳥巢！很可愛吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:34.79,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,可愛是很可愛啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.24,0:03:36.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我蹲著可就難受了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.14,0:03:40.75,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那至少留著墊子！軟綿綿的可舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:46.49,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,也好 這個就收下了...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.07,0:03:50.23,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,總之 我自己的事情我自己來做！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.69,0:03:52.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:57.20,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這種感覺是怎麼回事 她好像某個人啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.65,0:04:02.37,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼褲衩是好褲衩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:04.66,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,胖次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.21,0:04:04.71,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}那歌是什麼鬼...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.09,0:04:06.14,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,強而有力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.32,0:04:07.45,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,強力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.64,0:04:08.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,強而有力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.80,0:04:09.85,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,強力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:13.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小公主到是很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:18.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我作為騎士 也不能輸給她！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.71,0:04:29.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這也太可愛了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.86,0:04:34.22,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈 你們倆渾身是泥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:38.03,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我想到好東西了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.62,0:04:42.44,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你們玩水的時候 順便洗白白！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.65,0:04:43.52,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.87,0:04:44.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.12,0:04:46.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 我都說了...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.35,0:04:51.10,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己的事情 我自己會做的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.72,0:04:54.62,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,挺好的 幫小空弄的時候 順便給你也弄一弄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:58.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不要順便照顧我 我又不是小寶寶...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.19,0:05:00.68,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 吹乾了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.05,0:05:03.77,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這什麼鬼啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.05,0:05:06.64,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,肉嘟嘟！毛茸茸！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:09.60,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這個狀態變身成人的話 會是什麼樣子的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:10.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不會試！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:30.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空居然這麼早就睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.92,0:05:32.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶姐不愧是高手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.30,0:05:37.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:39.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:39.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.81,0:05:42.37,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,指甲塗得可愛 心情也會飛揚起來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.95,0:05:45.40,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對了！再來點這個！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.71,0:05:49.42,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,香粉！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.71,0:05:49.42,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Powder Fragrance！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.51,0:05:53.52,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這香味能讓人放鬆下來！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.27,0:05:56.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 小蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:05:59.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我通過跟小蝶姐一起生活
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:02.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,有點理解這個“飛揚”的意義了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:08.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,用可愛的事物 和快樂的活動 給自己增添活力 這就是飛揚！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.23,0:06:12.74,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈 用語言來形容的話 大概就是這個意思吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:15.47,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 少年也要來點嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.37,0:06:18.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,已經睡著了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:33.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.81,0:06:35.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,聖蝶華
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.98,0:06:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎喲 這插畫是幼兒園要用的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.54,0:06:42.04,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,欸嘿 是的 沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.47,0:06:44.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,都已經這麼晚了...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.03,0:06:52.98,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我比聖蝶華起得還要早！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.55,0:06:55.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我來做今天的早餐...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:57.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.55,0:07:00.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,聖蝶華！蝶華！你還好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.34,0:07:02.43,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.22,0:07:04.97,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 我睡過去了...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:07.87,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊 只是睡著了啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:12.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？難道你一整晚都在這裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:16.02,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？欸嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:18.16,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,“欸嘿”個什麼啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.65,0:07:21.78,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 蝶華也太拼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.17,0:07:23.04,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不 沒有這...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:26.23,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,有的就是有的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.28,0:07:28.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我都看到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.39,0:07:32.40,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天晚上 蝶華在這裡畫著什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.88,0:07:38.59,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白你是為了我們 做的各式各樣的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.16,0:07:44.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯麗和真白 肯定也不希望你這麼累的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.43,0:07:47.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:50.29,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,自己的事情 我自己能夠辦到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.59,0:07:54.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不如說 蝶華也可以多依靠一下我們嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.89,0:07:59.98,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,既然你都這麼說了 我就靠一靠吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:01.41,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.65,0:08:03.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,明天把時間留出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.73,0:08:05.89,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那我去床上睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.32,0:08:12.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,可... 可以啊 我就讓你靠一靠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.77,0:08:16.10,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘁 臭Precure們
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:19.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我可沒聽說你們又加人了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:22.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,一群弱雞集合起來舔傷口
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:26.02,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘁！把你們拆得四分五裂！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:31.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？四分五裂？對了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.72,0:08:34.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,把她們孤立起來戰鬥就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.39,0:08:37.45,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿嘿 嘿嘿嘿...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.93,0:08:42.18,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.77,0:08:47.18,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這是天窗幼兒園的小朋友們畫的藝術壁畫！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:52.16,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,天窗幼兒園是聖蝶華去教育實習的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.94,0:08:56.42,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？這裡還空著
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:08:59.11,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,留著給我們畫的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.33,0:09:00.72,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.10,0:09:17.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,幼兒園的老師跟我說 作為實習的留念 這塊你來畫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.89,0:09:21.78,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我因為搬家 東奔西走 都沒什麼時間...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.47,0:09:26.20,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你這麼忙 還來照顧我們嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.84,0:09:28.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,欸嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.32,0:09:30.87,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！少年畫得真棒！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.76,0:09:34.41,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸是畫家 我也就學了幾手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:35.77,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.18,0:09:39.84,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你在藍天大地的父母 都是怎麼樣的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.18,0:09:39.84,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(670,970)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.26,0:09:45.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 他們都不管我幾歲了 始終都把我當作小孩子看待
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.61,0:09:49.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼時候都要插手 有點煩呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.09,0:09:50.97,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.42,0:09:52.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.34,0:09:53.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:57.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我就感覺聖蝶華照料人的那種感覺 很像某個人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.73,0:10:00.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是像爸爸媽媽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.44,0:10:06.35,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 對不起 我說話沒過腦子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:08.66,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有 沒關係！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.14,0:10:13.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,也是啊 阿翼現在跟家人分開了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.71,0:10:17.04,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空和小晴也是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.41,0:10:18.66,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小白也是...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.55,0:10:20.93,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大概就是這個原因吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.18,0:10:23.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我想為你們做點什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.37,0:10:27.86,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,因為大家的努力 都看在我的眼裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.19,0:10:29.49,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,蝶華...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.85,0:10:31.47,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.20,0:10:33.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.37,0:10:35.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！不可以的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.25,0:10:36.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,壞寶寶！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:38.02,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,壞？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.22,0:10:39.82,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不如說很棒？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.02,0:10:40.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.11,0:10:43.60,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 添幾筆就是 鬱金香！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.25,0:10:46.41,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這只是阿翼 像不像？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:48.72,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈 真棒！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.05,0:10:52.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 小空 再用小手手多拍一點！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.21,0:10:56.00,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,拍！手手 拍！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:57.62,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈 繼續繼續！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.96,0:11:00.87,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 阿翼也發揮想像 隨意畫一點吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:02.93,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？我來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:06.62,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣才有3個人合作的感覺嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:11.38,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 既然蝶華都這麼說了...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:30.08,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,完成了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.47,0:11:31.82,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,完成
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:34.17,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你們倆！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.60,0:11:37.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,有你們幫忙 完成了最棒的壁畫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.52,0:11:39.97,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 真的沒有關係嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.39,0:11:42.43,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我和公主也參加進來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:44.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣才好啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:46.58,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這就所謂的相乘效果？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.94,0:11:51.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,相比我一個人來畫 現在的這副才更有趣嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:55.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你們是有多可憐...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.77,0:12:01.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,難得又增加一位 結果今天就到了倆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.22,0:12:03.83,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,虛蜢達！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.39,0:12:06.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧！暗塌谷能量！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.10,0:12:17.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
