Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.31,0:12:48.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.31,0:12:48.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:56.86,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飛奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:56.86,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.04,0:13:04.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,暢快躍起！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.04,0:13:04.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
