Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.85,0:13:28.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,高闊凌雲的勇氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.80,0:13:30.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.80,0:13:30.31,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}飛翼愈衛！
