Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:36.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,壯闊飛揚的神彩！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:36.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1095,970)}Wonderful
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.77,0:13:39.23,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Butterfly！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.77,0:13:39.23,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}蝴蝶愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:47.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然很痛心 但是戰鬥有時就是如此殘酷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.95,0:13:52.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,趁著另外2個還沒來 盡快結束戰鬥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.76,0:13:55.29,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你在耍什麼帥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.59,0:13:59.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是面對4個人 你就沒有能打贏的自信！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.28,0:13:59.86,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.09,0:14:02.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不是自不自信的問題
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:06.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我發動頭腦風暴的作戰計劃！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.06,0:14:08.96,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.61,0:14:12.61,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不能亂扔垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.87,0:14:14.28,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.64,0:14:18.59,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,垃圾就要進垃圾箱 走你！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.73,0:14:20.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦？啦啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.34,0:14:23.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什麼 就2個人 別被他們牽著走！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:26.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂... 亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.58,0:14:32.03,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.57,0:14:36.39,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:41.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.25,0:14:43.53,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.61,0:14:46.97,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.66,0:14:51.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,想得美！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:58.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 那副壁畫 看樣子是很重要的東西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.97,0:15:04.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:06.30,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.31,0:15:11.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 是這樣的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.20,0:15:12.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,對的 很期待呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.74,0:15:13.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噼噼！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.53,0:15:14.10,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.26,0:15:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噼噼！噼噼！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.61,0:15:17.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼的鳥朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:21.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:26.67,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨！喝！噠！呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:27.95,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,噠！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.42,0:15:39.06,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,上次你來幼兒園搗亂 這次又盯上了小朋友們的壁畫？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.45,0:15:43.21,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,像你這種卑鄙無恥的人 我是真心討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.49,0:15:45.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,可悲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.59,0:15:49.45,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我都已經將自己的善良發揮至極限了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.02,0:15:55.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,既然你這麼說了 就讓我們堂堂正正的來比比力氣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.69,0:15:59.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸和你的護盾 究竟誰更強？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.18,0:16:02.17,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.36,0:16:07.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.65,0:16:12.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Butterfly！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.70,0:16:15.76,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我來！我絕對會保護好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.75,0:16:24.66,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,壞！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.29,0:16:28.65,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,壞！蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.84,0:16:30.19,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,怎... 怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.13,0:16:33.47,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哇哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.66,0:16:34.78,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.27,0:16:38.66,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 小空也想要保護呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.53,0:16:42.90,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,老實說 護盾快要擋不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.32,0:16:45.66,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我來創造機會 你想辦法...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.82,0:16:46.56,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.74,0:16:48.44,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,就依靠我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.30,0:16:52.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就靠一靠吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.92,0:16:56.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我來繼續和它比力氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.53,0:17:00.12,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,噠！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.10,0:17:04.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.63,0:17:05.72,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.27,0:17:10.05,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.66,0:17:12.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.22,0:17:13.74,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.95,0:17:17.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.85,0:17:18.80,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.87,0:17:22.62,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們一起來守護吧 公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.12,0:17:24.85,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,掉眼淚就到此為止了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.11,0:17:27.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們飛揚起來吧 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.26,0:17:29.71,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,飛揚！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.34,0:17:34.92,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:46.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,太扯了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.36,0:17:50.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這個能讓我們像Sky和Prism那樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.89,0:17:52.30,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,試試看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
