Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:37.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,魔鏡平板！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:37.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mirrorpad！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.94,0:20:46.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.49,0:20:51.24,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了 Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.89,0:20:53.80,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,成是成了...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.15,0:20:56.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望這招數能再帥一點
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.32,0:21:00.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,到半當中的感覺還是不錯的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.91,0:21:04.20,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,挺好的嘛 這就是我們的風格嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.77,0:21:06.48,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,毛茸茸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.73,0:21:09.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘁 出差就是沒好事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.13,0:21:11.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,虛蜢蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.00,0:21:17.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊 發生了這種事...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.37,0:21:24.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,下次不要只依靠阿翼 也要多依靠我們 小蝶！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.40,0:21:25.70,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,會的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.98,0:21:28.73,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,老實說 我也有點太拼了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.89,0:21:33.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙一起 讓我們的生活飛揚起來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.23,0:21:36.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊！大伙一起神采飛揚！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.15,0:21:38.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,飛揚！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.94,0:21:40.26,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,飛揚！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.07,0:21:43.24,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飛...揚...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:47.11,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.32,0:21:48.94,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.43,0:21:51.69,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,誰去烤一下麵包？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.01,0:21:54.58,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,我去削蘋果
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.95,0:21:56.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我去！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.36,0:21:58.51,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我去準備飲料
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.69,0:22:00.91,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我去給小公主準備輔食！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.72,0:22:10.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Happy！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.72,0:22:10.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1070,970)}快樂愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.81,0:22:14.04,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起笑 超級開心！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.81,0:22:14.04,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1105,970)}Ultra Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.22,0:23:48.58,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可喜可賀 可喜可賀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.76,0:23:50.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在給小空讀畫書呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.94,0:23:52.63,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來 還有這個哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.82,0:23:54.62,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,創作畫書的大賽嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.78,0:23:56.03,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,很有趣的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.21,0:23:57.69,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小白也試試看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.86,0:23:59.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我挑戰一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.30,0:24:01.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.30,0:24:01.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.75,0:24:04.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白的夢想 最初的一步
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.34,0:01:01.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.55,0:01:07.14,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.35,0:01:12.69,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.69,0:01:20.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.59,0:01:25.57,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:29.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.79,0:01:31.29,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.29,0:01:35.59,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.17,0:01:40.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.26,0:01:42.13,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:46.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.10,0:01:50.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.66,0:01:54.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.71,0:01:54.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.09,0:01:56.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.46,0:01:56.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.47,0:02:01.82,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:06.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.72,0:02:11.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.96,0:02:16.54,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.92,0:02:19.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.46,0:02:27.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.12,0:22:30.79,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空萬里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.81,0:22:35.39,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能實現夢想與心願的蔚藍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.56,0:22:38.15,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開心中的麥克風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.15,0:22:39.98,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.98,0:22:42.36,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.82,0:22:45.28,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.28,0:22:47.24,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能與你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.24,0:22:49.91,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打開心靈+門扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.99,0:22:52.70,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已經激動到勢不可擋!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.70,0:22:54.37,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.50,0:22:57.04,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.15,0:23:03.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}還是那條街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.28,0:23:09.43,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那裡 這便是奇蹟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.43,0:23:11.74,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的寶貝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.45,0:23:16.12,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都過來！傳開這韻律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.12,0:23:20.38,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽起手 心連起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.38,0:23:26.49,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用溫暖的關懷 培育出的勇氣 是無窮無窮的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.55,0:23:30.72,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極的圖示是標記
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.72,0:23:34.89,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！這海闊天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.89,0:23:38.62,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們展開翅膀 飛向藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.62,0:23:39.98,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接起人與人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.98,0:23:42.69,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圓環！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
